# Spec Driven Development

## Rules

- Always check `specs/main.md` before proceeding.
- Also check `specs/state.md` to review current progress; edit this file when necessary.
- Make sure we are following the plan in the specs (e.g. `specs/main.md` or related spec files). If not, ask the user and update the specs together.

